{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13108140","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13108140","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1310814001:0":{"text":"那些活死人，他们还是会主动发起攻击……","source_cn":"那些活死人，他们还是会主动发起攻击……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF030482558660EEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1310814002:0":{"text":"瓦丽卡，为什么你和他们不同？","source_cn":"瓦丽卡，为什么你和他们不同？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5F72F49F563B943","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310814003:0":{"text":"和他们不同？别忘了，我也是你们口中的“活死人”。而且……他们曾经都是战士，最勇猛、最忠诚的战士。","source_cn":"和他们不同？别忘了，我也是你们口中的“活死人”。而且…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2AB519C8DA94D40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310814004:0":{"text":"你是说，他们曾经参加过神魔战争？","source_cn":"你是说，他们曾经参加过神魔战争？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FC0AA0852C4533A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310814005:1":{"text":"他们都曾在我的麾下，同我并肩作战，守卫这片土地。但现在我们却被这里的人们诅咒和厌弃……真可笑，是不是？","source_cn":"他们都曾在我的麾下，同我并肩作战，守卫这片土地。但现在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00CD057121525651","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1310814005":{"text":"他们都曾在我的麾下，同我并肩作战，守卫这片土地。但现在我们却被这里的人们诅咒和厌弃……真可笑，是不是？","source_cn":"他们都曾在我的麾下，同我并肩作战，守卫这片土地。但现在我们却被这里的人们诅咒和厌弃……真可笑，是不是？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00CD057121525651","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1310814006:0":{"text":"……你应该知道，战争会改变一切。","source_cn":"……你应该知道，战争会改变一切。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE0B15D81082A6166","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"……你应该知道，战争会改变一切。","female":"……你应该知道，战争会改变一切。","variant_male_record_index":"143701","variant_female_record_index":"143702","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1310814008:0":{"text":"瓦丽卡，能给我们讲讲当时的事情吗？","source_cn":"瓦丽卡，能给我们讲讲当时的事情吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5662F5AB19ABEB15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1310814009:0":{"text":"你们来到白山这些天，应该没少听到关于第一次神魔战争的传说吧？","source_cn":"你们来到白山这些天，应该没少听到关于第一次神魔战争的传说吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x792E4842A4FF7BFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1310814010:0":{"text":"嗯！纪念战争英雄的祭典，七瓣蓝绒花、花海里的遗迹和战士坟冢……这里有很多很多事情都和那场战争息息相关。","source_cn":"嗯！纪念战争英雄的祭典，七瓣蓝绒花、花海里的遗迹和战士...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32FE7DB6101B4684","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1310814011:1":{"text":"是啊……那场战争太惨烈了，惨烈到人们不得不将它刻印在血液里，不敢忘记。","source_cn":"是啊……那场战争太惨烈了，惨烈到人们不得不将它刻印在血...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14706D17FF182783","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1310814012:0":{"text":"那时候，除了走不动路的老人和年幼孩童，这里几乎所有的人都拿起武器上了战场，无论男女，不分种族。","source_cn":"那时候，除了走不动路的老人和年幼孩童，这里几乎所有的人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB425DF385373E7E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1310814013:0":{"text":"但我们还是无法抵抗恶魔的进攻，尤其是它们的首领——我们都叫她“冰之恶魔”——只要一个响指，就能将上百个出色的战士冻成碎冰。","source_cn":"但我们还是无法抵抗恶魔的进攻，尤其是它们的首领——我们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67A60CB84A85C6F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1310814014:0":{"text":"我们战死沙场。直到死神大人出现……祂将我们转化为亡灵，让我们可以再次燃烧心中的不甘与悔恨，可以拿起武器再次面对恶魔。","source_cn":"我们战死沙场。直到死神大人出现……祂将我们转化为亡灵，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68AE3ED86B90A041","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1310814014":{"text":"我们战死沙场。直到死神大人出现……祂将我们转化为亡灵，让我们可以再次燃烧心中的不甘与悔恨，可以拿起武器再次面对恶魔。","source_cn":"我们战死沙场。直到死神大人出现……祂将我们转化为亡灵，让我们可以再次燃烧心中的不甘和悔恨，可以拿起武器再次面对恶魔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68AE3ED86B90A041","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1310814015:0":{"text":"是的，死神大人……祂突然出现，给了我们选择。而我们……选择成为亡灵，继续战斗。","source_cn":"是的，死神大人……祂突然出现，给了我们选择。而我们……...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1876A0FA46679E21","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"是的，死神大人……祂突然出现，给了我们选择。而我们……选择成为亡灵，继续战斗。","female":"是的，死神大人……祂突然出现，给了我们选择。而我们……选择成为亡灵，继续战斗。","variant_male_record_index":"143712","variant_female_record_index":"143713","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1310814017:1":{"text":"可是，为什么现在你的神智还很清晰，但那些活死人……你的战友，他们却失去理性了呢？","source_cn":"可是，为什么现在你的神智还很清晰，但那些活死人……你的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E446A45112E92C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1310814018:1":{"text":"战争结束了，人们一代代传承，总会慢慢遗忘伤痛，归于平静。但我们不能。两千多年来，我们始终活在战争的痛苦里。","source_cn":"战争结束了，人们一代代传承，总会慢慢遗忘伤痛，归于平静...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B89D5CCCBED05C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1310814019:0":{"text":"战火毫不停息地灼烧着我们的内心，折磨着我们的灵魂——永恒生命的代价，就是永恒的痛苦。","source_cn":"战火毫不停息地灼烧着我们的内心，折磨着我们的灵魂——永...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B54BE21EC74831B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1310814020:0":{"text":"我的战友们……他们无惧恶魔的威胁，却无法抵抗这样的痛苦。终于，他们被痛苦吞噬，失去了自我，变得疯狂，成为了你们口中的“活死人”。","source_cn":"我的战友们……他们无惧恶魔的威胁，却无法抵抗这样的痛苦...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x509E2C3ADAAACDA9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1310814021:0":{"text":"人们对这一切毫不知情，将我们视作恶魔的眷属、邪恶的化身——不，我并不责怪他们，可还是会觉得无奈。","source_cn":"人们对这一切毫不知情，将我们视作恶魔的眷属、邪恶的化身...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD984C30138CF7B1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1310814022:0":{"text":"居然是这样……","source_cn":"居然是这样……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71F4CBAB6C8FE251","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1310814023:0":{"text":"……来吧，我带你们去战场中心看看。","source_cn":"……来吧，我带你们去战场中心看看。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x279DD7796D11D17C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:16:0:1":{"text":"死神？！","source_cn":"死神？！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xEFA20AA5BBABAEB9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"死神？！","female":"死神？！","variant_male_record_index":"68320","variant_female_record_index":"68321","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1310814016:0":{"text":"咦，这么说，那些活死人曾经和你一样有自我意识？","source_cn":"咦，这么说，那些活死人曾经和你一样有自我意识？","status":"matched","hash_x